58f2d01a8f6371f","node_id":"C_kwDOGd35idoAKGYzOTk3ZWYwYmMwZjMzYmIzYWZmMDRlNTE1OGYyZDAxYThmNjM3MWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jcr-stats/commit/0b63366b85cf37b17c459101381ac55c4600a466","sha":"0b63366b85cf37b17c459101381ac55c4600a466","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-stats/commits/0b63366b85cf37b17c459101381ac55c4600a466"}],"sha":"f3997ef0bc0f33bb3aff04e5158f2d01a8f6371f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-stats/commits/f3997ef0bc0f33bb3aff04e5158f2d01a8f6371f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-stats/commits/0b63366b85cf37b17c459101381ac55c4600a466/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T19:22:42Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T19:22:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: patch test-harness dependencies (#16)\n\nResolves all open Dependabot alerts (all in the Cypress test harness):\n- undici <=6.27.0 (low/medium/high) -> resolution ^6.27.0\n- tar <=7.5.15 (medium) -> resolution ^7.5.16, resolves to 7.5.19\n- @babel/core <=7.29.0 (low) -> resolution ^7.29.6, resolves to 7.29.7\n- form-data <2.5.6 & <4.0.6 (high) -> fresh install: 2.5.6 and 4.0.6\n- js-yaml <3.15.0 & 4.0.0-4.1.1 (medium) -> fresh install: 3.15.0 and 4.3.0\n\nMulti-major form-data and js-yaml are fixed via a fresh Yarn Classic\nlockfile regen (each major resolves to its own patched tail). Converts\nthe tests/ lockfile config from Yarn Berry to Classic to match the\n@jahia/cypress harness.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"665f9eb6dc0ad16e39c9ad85eed528180f0a0ff3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-stats/git/trees/665f9eb6dc0ad16e39c9ad85eed528180f0a0ff3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-stats/git/commits/0b63366b85cf37b17c459101381ac55c4600a466","verification":{"payload":"tree 665f9eb6dc0ad16e39c9ad85eed528180f0a0ff3\nparent 01aa77af84d4cf5d83250f385e32346499c0442b\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783538562 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783538562 +0200\n\nfix: patch test-harness dependencies (#16)\n\nResolves all open Dependabot alerts (all in the Cypress test harness):\n- undici <=6.27.0 (low/medium/high) -> resolution ^6.27.0\n- tar <=7.5.15 (medium) -> resolution ^7.5.16, resolves to 7.5.19\n- @babel/core <=7.29.0 (low) -> resolution ^7.29.6, resolves to 7.29.7\n- form-data <2.5.6 & <4.0.6 (high) -> fresh install: 2.5.6 and 4.0.6\n- js-yaml <3.15.0 & 4.0.0-4.1.1 (medium) -> fresh install: 3.15.0 and 4.3.0\n\nMulti-major form-data and js-yaml are fixed via a fresh Yarn Classic\nlockfile regen (each major resolves to its own patched tail). Converts\nthe tests/ lockfile config from Yarn Berry to Classic to match the\n@jahia/cypress harness.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTqOCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsBwQAGMt/eia99pDZ9QO4Y9JUOS5\n56RXDSJlmWd0kT8Mx7wuAXrtbE8jjme