ers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-stats/commits/108eb6a4821a58ee2a7cb2f4a4418610f73d2ae1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T12:43:53Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T12:43:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf: walk JCR tree via getNodes() instead of per-node SQL2 query (#8)\n\nReplace the per-node ISCHILDNODE JCR-SQL2 query with direct\nJCRNodeWrapper.getNodes() hierarchy iteration. This removes a query\nparse/plan/index lookup and a redundant path resolution at every node,\nand reads committed hierarchy state instead of possibly-lagging index\nstate. The legacy strategy stays available for A/B benchmarking behind\n-DjcrStats.traversal=query (default: direct).\n\nAlso move session.refresh(false) to a single call at traversal entry\n(was firing once per node) and add JcrStatsTraversalTest with a\ntest-scoped Mockito dependency. Sync package.json to 2.1.1-SNAPSHOT.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"4707fe42f83429f74902618fb521ec3fb1b3bdad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-stats/git/trees/4707fe42f83429f74902618fb521ec3fb1b3bdad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jcr-stats/git/commits/108eb6a4821a58ee2a7cb2f4a4418610f73d2ae1","verification":{"payload":"tree 4707fe42f83429f74902618fb521ec3fb1b3bdad\nparent f2cdd336e106bca92d617014724ea085d317aaca\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782218633 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782218633 +0200\n\nperf: walk JCR tree via getNodes() instead of per-node SQL2 query (#8)\n\nReplace the per-node ISCHILDNODE JCR-SQL2 query with direct\nJCRNodeWrapper.getNodes() hierarchy iteration. This removes a query\nparse/plan/index lookup and a redundant path resolution at every node,\nand reads committed hierarchy state instead of possibly-lagging index\nstate. The legacy strategy stays available for A/B benchmarking behind\n-DjcrStats.traversal=query (default: direct).\n\nAlso move session.refresh(false) to a single call at traversal entry\n(was firing once per node) and add JcrStatsTraversalTest with a\ntest-scoped Mockito dependency. Sync package.json to 2.1.1-SNAPSHOT.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOn+JCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKUIQACxThkeb9zO7hEzoE1wOicXb\nmYWAyhv6m7MZaFdvZ/gndXdOZe/WgPmztdmoZcJktUc3FnX2lg+j9bBJjaXGZ8bP\nm0KQtMpUiCshAjQW34o3Q3Ds9cx6aK+uN/96ftR7c2iJadlPyJz7Nv5QrA+8Y1kK\nu20zqGeFgnwtWlgqT5+CkW+c/O0HL1xoOxVM7G8tdG754i2v6E2FqWoIsso09kJt\nITcpuwrKqrhsPnGdQe+hH0HOI2TWu77h5aTF2LizwmJ9VF0dc3H/UKuPQMbF5mgC\nsyLUXX/YNeFPlxwvZtQlY/mVExtlY0xi0+MXPTcgOQCq8hovIZhFE2pZ+ah5KVLy\nbqq9PPIEC46s16C16jjtpgZeD/A7YLzOYhd7tEWSNaqL0e++HeopeU+UYHEOie50\nQrN78eKLMCzVwncOAnhikggZjZWndgFYCqpmKNxdyb0te2A4VIDsSsLeLOylxo3N\n2G9BD4ab7RHkoBei42SRWpjH6F41PApUV+967QRvtoe+5fy6570vxrZXkDCJhOQJ\nQjdPuMjI9xoOoyTYWaBJnx+iTrJDUsebsiejKPc7JqebwQ5h2R5eB+qbLv6+cTJ4\nFA62tDNZhSiz39zPNr1ttInxIn5VyQvxFzksZJDyL35Uj2UJzsFFsAEYAc46wSUB\nf68neziR1dK9TacJWzR2\n=hgnN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"202