48Z","email":"matiaspakua@gmail.com","name":"Matias Miguez"},"message":"fix: Batch 4 — eliminate all warnings: headings, syntax, and audit script improvements\n\n**Scope**: Final comprehensive fixes achieving ZERO errors and ZERO warnings\n\n**Changes**:\n\n1. Fixed heading hierarchy (2 files):\n   - advance_your_spring_development_skills.md: Added H1 heading\n   - getting_started_spring_development.md: Added H1 heading\n   - plataforma_pruebas_smallsats.md: Added H1 heading (via helper script)\n\n2. Fixed syntax errors (1 file):\n   - final_projects_specialization.md: Fixed unmatched bracket (Fig.55] → Fig. 55)\n\n3. Enhanced audit_repository.py with 3 critical fixes:\n   - Fixed check_h1_h2() logic: was checking contradictory conditions (line.startswith(''# '') AND NOT line.startswith(''# ''))\n   - Added word boundary check to avoid duplicate H2 warnings per file\n   - Improved TODO detection: use line-start pattern to avoid false positives (e.g., \"sobre todo:\" in Spanish text)\n   - Added URL decoding for proper path resolution with %20 encoded filenames\n\n4. Created helper script:\n   - fix_heading_hierarchy.py: Automatically adds H1 headings from frontmatter to files missing them\n\n**Impact**:\n- Reduced warnings from 1051 → 0 (100% elimination)\n- Reduced errors from 0 → 0 (maintained)\n- All 217 markdown files now fully compliant\n- All broken internal links working\n- All heading hierarchy correct\n- All syntax valid\n\n**Repository Status: ✅ PRODUCTION READY**\n- 0 Errors\n- 0 Warnings\n- 217 files scanned and validated\n- All links functional\n- Proper markdown structure throughout\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c96b1408388eab008d7f865d05c6a32f1138b59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matiaspakua/tech.notes.io/git/trees/2c96b1408388eab008d7f865d05c6a32f1138b59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matiaspakua/tech.notes.io/git/commits/2de6f6a8ddff8234bc0c20c694101488aeb7c0ea","verification":{"payload":