 activation staggered\n- Conexiones: stroke-dashoffset pen-trace animation (trazado visual)\n- Zoom: gsap viewBox interpolation suave\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: Knowledge Atlas integrado en GitHub Pages\n\n- Agrega visualización D3 interactiva como sección del index, embebida en iframe\n- Build de Vite configurado para outputear a atlas/ con base /tech.notes.io/atlas/\n- Fix bug de loading: constructor lanzaba this._entrance() (método inexistente)\n- Fix URLs de notas: agrega prefijo pages/ para evitar 404 al abrir notas\n- main.js simplificado: import estático, sin dynamic import, sin doble rAF\n- Excluye visualization/ de Jekyll para que no procese los sources\n- Workflow GitHub Actions que re-buildea atlas/ automáticamente en main\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add skill on motion design\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqMDtyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYn0QAEh3e+gdOoQJhJ+F4Tt8BFJW\nir73P/XI5YwX8qooPt6gbU9SIUTebyqmTcORVZm8x4yfs88o/wL2HZPVt/yIl3co\n3TSzOZaXeNm72hv9Y4OJcucxfLvwu8jM09MMCvRa+iouNSAdE2x91si9WT7dg4ft\nbkjDnUK0SQQ4h6CrJM6JhAC6YYubsLBwdzqzFySlmRS+nUF6SXev8dtnGabPiD1F\n2z+azw37W5ri22yZXyngIdXBXNiL4cljOAkpz+zSbUFwq7eCGdeTDOFEkFZK1tzG\nIaK5CHpGTR2ylJoyDh3w9gH26YUaBKMWxkhB9V4jRvRtRRrthe3UVfTi626svOw8\nvSEb9L+pwh7KQnb96SAauTYgpHbVNWIs5cFfWHD7oe5WgIBWbdIwQhp3i5RSKc0s\nn93mw+LLQ/vRRbSvKuDAob2chvwZSeh8SVg9AFvrFWWcQie3xdxQe2Hbz/RIgH0B\nqlDaAzz3rk7PPnr3n1CWhuLuWAXMxT9uCTQppifQ0hOoBQ/aZekskR9rMz865Ohc\n363jSeeWLqgKNvEau0kW+PxqcAYuvnijPKuK/kQFqjhcquLzBu7iXG96qCt7KO8w\neIckLQc+1LHkTzUToFqeS0jlpWYQ9hRGmkJ+oRrQELa+lKHTGfZGKpx128efzKXI\naX3GXn4KCkwCV5crYHrH\n=0IBQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-15T17:50:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events