s\n\nArchive two fully-implemented spec-driven changes (moved to\nopenspec/changes/archive/):\n\n- add-osgi-spec-test-coverage: completed the ported OSGi interfaces\n  (LogLevel AUDIT/TRACE + trace/audit, Bundle.update, LDAP ~=,\n  ServiceTracker waitForService/remove/getTrackingCount/getTracked/\n  isEmpty/getServiceReference); fixed Config Admin service.pid/\n  service.factoryPid injection and Event property-copy conformance\n  bugs; added broad spec-grounded test coverage; fixed LDAP escaping/\n  array, Version value-match, setProperties read-only keys, Config\n  double-deleted and late-registration divergences.\n\n- wire-scr-service-events: wired the SCR to runtime service events via\n  a re-entrancy-safe serialized event queue; completed greedy/reluctant/\n  mandatory-loss/survivor-rebind conformance at runtime; resolves the\n  #6 (dormant pipeline) and #4 (survivor rebind) follow-ups.\n\nadd-scr-lifecycle-conformance stays active (SA-DLY delayed components\nremains open). Full suite: 701 tests green; tsc, oxlint, build clean.","tree":{"sha":"b3a73fa8e768ae55e1e4df1d80d5a1522e6e6a16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BlackBeltTechnology/pandino/git/trees/b3a73fa8e768ae55e1e4df1d80d5a1522e6e6a16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BlackBeltTechnology/pandino/git/commits/35c1d1d2913372b658b586ac0de5c53f698e4827","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1084847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noherczeg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noherczeg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noherczeg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noherczeg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/noherczeg","id":1084847,"login":"noherczeg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODQ4NDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noherczeg/o