 spec coverage\n\nImplements the add-osgi-spec-test-coverage change:\n- Completes ported OSGi interfaces: LogLevel AUDIT/TRACE + trace()/audit(),\n  Bundle.update(module?), LDAP ~= approximate match, and ServiceTracker\n  waitForService/remove/getTrackingCount/getTracked/isEmpty/getServiceReference.\n- Fixes conformance bugs: Config Admin service.pid/service.factoryPid injection\n  and Event property-copy (defensive clone).\n- Fixes divergences: LDAP escaped \\* + multi-valued props, Version value-based\n  match, setProperties read-only keys, Config double-deleted + late delivery.\n- Adds broad spec-grounded tests across framework, LDAP, version, config,\n  event, log, and service-tracker.\n- Bootstraps OpenSpec tooling (.claude + .pi opsx skills/prompts/commands,\n  openspec/config.yaml).","tree":{"sha":"04a4c4b0b7c9c8085955cd533c8e473402b99224","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BlackBeltTechnology/pandino/git/trees/04a4c4b0b7c9c8085955cd533c8e473402b99224"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BlackBeltTechnology/pandino/git/commits/537e947192c9c596595ac89195d5e22a2f72021f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1084847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noherczeg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noherczeg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noherczeg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noherczeg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/noherczeg","id":1084847,"login":"noherczeg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODQ4NDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noherczeg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noherczeg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noherczeg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noherczeg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscr