ts had rotted\nsilently: the Community Contributions heading gif was deleted from Tenor\n(404), and freeicons.io now blocks hotlinking (403).\n\n- trophies      -> trophy.ryglcloud.net (load-balancing mirror listed in\n                   ryo-ma/github-profile-trophy''s own README)\n- 30-day graph  -> activity-graph.vercel.app\n- heading gif   -> github/explore open-source icon\n- React Router  -> github/explore react-router icon\n\nVerified all four render real data for this username, and re-checked\nevery other image in the README. The two icon replacements are\nGitHub-hosted, so they can''t be hotlink-blocked or rate limited.\n\nNote: github-profile-trophy.vercel.app was itself the fix applied in #29\nwhen a previous mirror died. These community-run endpoints are inherently\nunstable; self-hosting is the durable option if this recurs.","tree":{"sha":"14f61e8e3058c3ed3a528dfa7ba1d2e883455e13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sachin-gupta99/sachin-gupta99/git/trees/14f61e8e3058c3ed3a528dfa7ba1d2e883455e13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sachin-gupta99/sachin-gupta99/git/commits/b734b73c7d7f72098e7dc4485cf17fb3fa3cf804","verification":{"payload":"tree 14f61e8e3058c3ed3a528dfa7ba1d2e883455e13\nparent 58f4eb6dd2859ee9477f98ebd0c67f7fe4cb552c\nauthor Sachin Gupta <sachin.gupta.2j99@gmail.com> 1789282089 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789282089 +0530\n\nfix: repoint four dead README image hosts to live endpoints (#31)\n\nThe Github Trophies and \"Last 30 days\" contribution graph sections both\nrendered as broken images. Their hosts return HTTP 402\n(DEPLOYMENT_DISABLED) — the upstream Vercel deployments were disabled,\nso the endpoints are gone rather than merely rate limited.\n\nWhile checking the rest of the README, two more assets had rotted\nsilently: the Community Contributions heading gif was deleted from Tenor\n(404), and freeicons.io now blocks hotlinking (403).\n\n- trophies      -> trophy.ryglcloud.net (load-balancing mirror listed in\n